    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Armax Arsenal built this slug-firing shotgun for turian marksmen who distrust anything that scatters. It fires a single stabilized slug, holds its accuracy well past normal shotgun range, and ships with more adjustment points than most sniper rifles. Owners are known for being unavailable while they tune it.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
